      "description": "Only launch stamps transcript_path with the window's config dir. Respawn, hard respawn and fix rounds (relaunchWindow, relaunchWorker) open a window on their own command's env but never re-stamp it. A session relaunched from a shell naming a different CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR then shows its context as unknown, or shows the killed window's stale tokens. This is display-only and not a regression.",
